### Health
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/health

### Single prompt
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/v1/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userInput": "How much should I score in each subject to pass CA final?"
}

### Batch prompt
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/v1/generate/batch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userInputs": [
    "Explain Flask",
    "Explain MongoDB",
    "Explain asyncio"
  ]
}
